.TH DIFFALLA-COMPARE 1 "November 2025" "diffalla 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
diffalla\-compare \- compare two directories or snapshots
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B diffalla compare
\fISOURCE\fR \fIDESTINATION\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compares two directories or snapshots and reports differences. Can compare:
.IP \(bu 2
Two directories (creates temporary snapshots)
.IP \(bu 2
Two snapshots (fast, no file system access)
.IP \(bu 2
Directory vs snapshot (one temporary snapshot)
.PP
Reports three categories of changes:
.IP \(bu 2
Added files (in destination, not in source)
.IP \(bu 2
Removed files (in source, not in destination)
.IP \(bu 2
Modified files (different content or metadata)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-summary
Show summary only (counts, no file listings)
.TP
.B \-\-added
Show only added files
.TP
.B \-\-removed
Show only removed files
.TP
.B \-\-modified
Show only modified files
.TP
.B \-f, \-\-format \fIFORMAT\fR
Output format: text (default), json, html, diff
.TP
.B \-o, \-\-output \fIPATH\fR
Write output to file instead of stdout
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Compare two directories:
.PP
.RS
.nf
diffalla compare /dir\-a /dir\-b
.fi
.RE
.PP
Compare snapshots (fast):
.PP
.RS
.nf
diffalla compare baseline.db current.db
.fi
.RE
.PP
Show only added files:
.PP
.RS
.nf
diffalla compare /old /new \-\-added
.fi
.RE
.PP
Export as JSON:
.PP
.RS
.nf
diffalla compare /dir\-a /dir\-b \-f json \-o diff.json
.fi
.RE
.PP
Summary only:
.PP
.RS
.nf
diffalla compare baseline.db /current/dir \-\-summary
.fi
.RE
.SH OUTPUT
.PP
Text format (default):
.RS
.nf
Comparison Results
==================
Added:    5 files
Removed:  2 files
Modified: 3 files

Added files:
  + new\-file.txt
  + subdir/another.txt

Removed files:
  \- old\-file.txt

Modified files:
  * changed.txt
.fi
.RE
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
No differences found (directories are identical)
.TP
.B 1
Differences found
.TP
.B 2
Usage error
.TP
.B 3
File system error
.SH PERFORMANCE
.PP
Snapshot-to-snapshot comparison: <1 second for 100,000 files (SQL-powered)
.PP
Directory-to-directory: Limited by file system scan speed
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR diffalla (1),
.BR diffalla\-snapshot (1),
.BR diffalla\-patch (1)
